usage: plan.py links [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT]
                     [--direction {out,in,both}] [--kind KIND] [--depth DEPTH]
                     plan ref

read typed links around a reference (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  ref

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --direction {out,in,both}
  --kind KIND           comma-separated edge kinds
  --depth DEPTH         graph traversal depth (integer >= 1)
